		"name": "TurfBari API Collection",
		"description": "TurfBari backend: Auth (signup/login/password reset), Users, Turf Companies, Grounds (multi-sport + search), Slots, Bookings (online + manual).\n\nFlow: login -> (owner) Select Active Company -> create ground -> Search/Get Slots -> Create Booking. Login and create requests save auth_token and ids into collection variables automatically.",
